xt":"연결","x":1465,"y":1500,"width":55,"height":34}]},{"text":"한다 연결 할당의 경우 외부 단편화가 없고 모든 볼록은 크기가 같기 때문에 가용 공간","words":[{"text":"한다","x":305,"y":1563,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"연결","x":389,"y":1563,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"할당의","x":457,"y":1563,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"경우","x":557,"y":1564,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"외부","x":625,"y":1563,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"단편화가","x":694,"y":1561,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"없고","x":826,"y":1561,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":896,"y":1563,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"볼록은","x":968,"y":1560,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"크기가","x":1075,"y":1558,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"같기","x":1187,"y":1558,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"때문에","x":1269,"y":1559,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"가용","x":1384,"y":1559,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"공간","x":1462,"y":1559,"width":61,"height":34}]},{"text":"리스트의 어떠한 가용 블록들을 이용하여도 무방하다. 파일 생성 시 생성할 파일의 크기","words":[{"text":"리스트의","x":308,"y":1621,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"어떠한","x":438,"y":1622,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"가용","x":534,"y":1622,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"블록들을","x":602,"y":1621,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"이용하여도","x":732,"y":1620,"width":146,"height":35},{"text":"무방하다.","x":889,"y":1619,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":1033,"y":1617,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"생성","x":1109,"y":1617,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"시","x":1188,"y":1617,"width":29,"height":35},{"text":"생성할","x":1234,"y":1617,"width":104,"height":35},{"text":"파일의","x":1350,"y":1617,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"크기","x":1461,"y":1617,"width":57,"height":35}]},{"text":"가 미리 고정될 필요도 없다. 파일은 계속해서 얼마든지 커질 수 있으며 디스크 공간을","words":[{"text":"가","x":307,"y":1680,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"미리","x":350,"y":1680,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"고정될","x":421,"y":1680,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"필요도","x":521,"y":1680,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"없다.","x":621,"y":1680,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"파일은","x":698,"y":1680,